---
title: Operational Mode State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> FACTORY: Manufacturing

    FACTORY: 🏭 FACTORY
    FACTORY: Shipped state
    FACTORY: All ops disabled
    FACTORY: GPU Platform unpowered

    BOOTSTRAP: 🔵 BOOTSTRAP
    BOOTSTRAP: Training / learning window
    BOOTSTRAP: Orchestrator active
    BOOTSTRAP: GPU Platform POWERED
    BOOTSTRAP: Writes allowed

    SEALED: 🔒 SEALED
    SEALED: Production operations
    SEALED: Front end tokenizes the waveform
    SEALED: and scans for anomalies
    SEALED: No orchestration writes
    SEALED: GPU Platform UNPOWERED
    SEALED: Capture + queue only

    AWAITING_SME: 📞 AWAITING_SME
    AWAITING_SME: Handshake gate (~60-s default)
    AWAITING_SME: System has called the SME and
    AWAITING_SME: is waiting for them to accept
    AWAITING_SME: GPU Platform PRE-WARMED (L1.2 ready, no inference)
    AWAITING_SME: No orchestration writes
    AWAITING_SME: Auto-returns to SEALED on timeout

    INVESTIGATION: 🔍 INVESTIGATION
    INVESTIGATION: Live SME troubleshooting (15-min session)
    INVESTIGATION: GPU Platform POWERED (inference only)
    INVESTIGATION: NO orchestration writes
    INVESTIGATION: Read station + process bus
    INVESTIGATION: Read settings + COMTRADE
    INVESTIGATION: Extra relay protection ENABLED

    FACTORY --> BOOTSTRAP: commission_to_bootstrap()<br/>single-key auth<br/>commissioning engineer

    BOOTSTRAP --> SEALED: seal_for_operations()<br/>TWO-KEY auth<br/>cooldown enforced<br/>powers down GPU Platform

    SEALED --> BOOTSTRAP: open_bootstrap_window()<br/>TWO-KEY auth<br/>cooldown enforced<br/>powers up GPU Platform

    SEALED --> AWAITING_SME: request_sme_handshake()<br/>single-key auth<br/>NO cooldown — armed immediately<br/>powers GPU Platform to L1.2 (pre-warm)<br/>handshake timer resets

    AWAITING_SME --> INVESTIGATION: sme_accepts_handshake()<br/>single-key auth, no cooldown<br/>GPU Platform L1.2 → full inference<br/>extra relay protection ON<br/>starts 15-min session timer

    AWAITING_SME --> SEALED: cancel_handshake() or<br/>handshake_timed_out()<br/>no cooldown<br/>powers down GPU Platform (L1.2 → off)<br/>(SME declined or did not answer)

    INVESTIGATION --> SEALED: sme_hangs_up() (manual) or<br/>investigation_timer_expires() (timeout)<br/>no cooldown<br/>microVMs powered off<br/>RAM cryptographically erased<br/>audit hash sealed in permanent memory<br/>powers down GPU Platform

    note right of BOOTSTRAP
        Bootstrap window typical durations:
        • Initial commission: 30 days
        • Quarterly recal: 1-2 days
        • Post-incident: hours to days
    end note

    note right of SEALED
        Default production state.
        Voice tags queue for next BOOTSTRAP.
        Novel events flagged for review.
        Catch-up batch on next open.
    end note

    note left of FACTORY
        One-way: cannot return to FACTORY.
        Commissioning is irreversible.
    end note

    note right of INVESTIGATION
        Short-lived diagnostic mode.
        On exit (SME hangs up OR timer):
          • microVMs powered off
          • RAM crypto-erased
          • erase-hash committed to
            permanent audit memory
        Auto-returns to SEALED.
    end note

    note left of AWAITING_SME
        Handshake gate.
        INVESTIGATION cannot be entered
        without the SME explicitly
        accepting the call here.
        GPU Platform is pre-warmed to L1.2
        during the wait so accept→
        inference is sub-second.
        If they don't answer, the
        handshake_timed_out event
        returns the system to SEALED
        and powers the GPU Platform back down.
    end note
